<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>tsb this macro will cancel any move 1 animation. the key script look stupid but it works, stand still and press the key that you binded for this macro.
the reason why i don't add delays is because it won't do the stuff correctly.</Description>
